WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.876
Hey, I'm Wheels.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.421
Yes, they call me that
on account of the wheelchair.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.507
It's a little on the nose,
but I like it because it's cool.

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:09.551
Okay.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.387
You probably think I'm in the chair
'cause my legs are weak,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.888
but it's the opposite.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.808
My muscles are so strong
my bones can't support 'em.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:19.644
But lucky for me,
my brain's the same way.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.187
It's supercharged,

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:22.313
so I'm good.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.107
So, Wheels, who's your new friend?

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.734
Missy, this is Noodles.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.902
We call him that because, well…

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.196
He stretches and twists around
like a noodle?

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.322
Yeah, basically.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.450
And that's Ojo.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.618
Her power is she's a genius drawer.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.372
Like Van Gogh mixed with Monet
with just a sprinkle of Salvador Dali.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.457
Can I see that?

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.587
A kid standing on top of floating chairs?

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:51.134
An exploding exercise ball?

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.886
Nothing she draws makes sense.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:54.763
[Missy] That me?

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:59.142
-Why'd you draw me in front of the class?
-Oh, she won't answer.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.227
She only speaks through her drawings.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:05.398
♪ Don't speak
I know just what you're saying ♪

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:05.982
No, you don't.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.567
You have no clue. 
what she is saying

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.069
And this is A Capella.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:11.738
-It me.
-That's your superpower? You can sing?

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:14.115
Yep, but I have an unusual range.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:17.077
I can go low… [sings very low]

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:20.914
or I can go high! [sings very high]

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:22.749
I can even go really…

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:23.750
[inaudible]

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:25.668
I don't hear anything.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.545
It's beyond human hearing.

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:28.546
[feedback]

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.298
[Granada] Miss A Capella Vox,

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:32.592
please refrain from using your high voice.

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:36.638
Every dog in the neighborhood
has surrounded our building.

00:01:36.721 --> 00:01:38.306
[laughter]

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:41.643
And she can sing so low
that she moves objects.

00:01:41.726 --> 00:01:43.686
Show her how you make things float!

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.147
[sings very low]

00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:04.165
[gasps]

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:21.182
All righty, let's see who's left.

00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:23.685
That's Blinding Fast's kid, Slo-Mo.

00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:29.107
[Wheels] He's actually moving very fast,

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:31.985
but somehow,
his powers have him stuck in a time warp.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.529
[slowly] Hi.

00:02:36.281 --> 00:02:37.448
That kid over there…

00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:40.243
Two packs of candy for crossing our eyes.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.494
…is Facemaker.

00:02:42.203 --> 00:02:43.037
Okay.

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:47.125
Beat that.

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:49.460
He makes the craziest faces.

00:02:54.465 --> 00:02:55.925
It's impossible!

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:58.553
I can even change my face
to look like you.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.139
[crunching]

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.601
He's cheating! I can't compete with that!

00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:08.563
Oh, dude!

00:03:09.063 --> 00:03:10.940
Rewind, clean up on aisle two.

00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:15.278
That's Rewind.
He can rewind time but just a few seconds.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.614
[winding back]

00:03:23.786 --> 00:03:25.246
[Facemaker screams]

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.794
They're twins. It's crazy, right?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.422
What twins? What are you talking about?

00:03:35.006 --> 00:03:37.091
Fast Forward, are you at it again?

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:40.803
You were taking so long, I skipped you
forward a bit. Sorry, not sorry.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.680
She and Rewind are twins.

00:03:42.764 --> 00:03:44.140
Opposite powers.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.227
The only thing they agree on
is they don't like each other.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.686
-At all.
-At all.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.772
They're twins. It's crazy, right?

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:54.400
And then,
there's our fearless leader, Wild Card.

00:03:54.984 --> 00:03:57.654
There's not a single power
in the world he doesn't have.

00:03:58.238 --> 00:03:59.113
True.

00:03:59.197 --> 00:04:01.449
Sure, he has every power imaginable,

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:05.036
but since he can't focus his energy,
they show up randomly.

00:04:05.119 --> 00:04:06.079
Also true…

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:08.081
until now that is.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:10.124
Teleport!

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.837
[siren wails]

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:18.675
And last, but definitely not least,

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.218
Guppy.

00:04:20.718 --> 00:04:22.303
How are you making that?

00:04:22.387 --> 00:04:25.265
My mommy is Lavagirl,
but my daddy is Sharkboy.

00:04:25.348 --> 00:04:28.184
So instead of lava, I move water.

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:30.520
[sizzling]

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:33.564
I need hydration for my powers to work.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:46.286
[gasping]

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:49.289
-[Missy] That's really cool.
-[giggling] Thanks.

